<p>This was a collaboration between myself and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trainman2001" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2075284); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2075284&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1453923094" alt="TrainMan2001" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2075284)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trainman2001" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2075284); return false;">TrainMan2001</a></span>.</p>
<p>A special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/some-potato" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2341932); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2341932&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1453923094" alt="Some_Potato" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2341932)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/some-potato" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2341932); return false;">Some_Potato</a></span> for advice regarding medical things, specifically emergency medicine, and his help with reviewing it in the final stages of completion. Another special thanks goes to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ribby97" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2299134); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2299134&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1453923094" alt="ribby97" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2299134)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ribby97" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2299134); return false;">ribby97</a></span> for providing detailed feedback in the final stages of editing, allowing me to remove all the rough edges and catching the little things that I couldn't after staring at it for several hours.</p>
<p>In no particular order, I would like to thank all of the following people for their feedback while we were creating this SCP:</p>
<ul>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2005044); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2005044&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1453923094" alt="Decibelles" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2005044)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/decibelles" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2005044); return false;">Decibelles</a></span></li>
